                </p>
            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- PORTFOLIO SECTION -->

    <section class="portfolio" id="portfolio">

        <div class="section-heading">

            <h2>Our Portfolio</h2>

            <p>
                A showcase of creativity, passion and professional design.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="portfolio-grid">

            <div class="portfolio-item">
                <p>Brand Identity Projects</p>
            </div>

            <div class="portfolio-item">
                <p>Flyer & Poster Designs</p>
            </div>

            <div class="portfolio-item">
                <p>Printing Projects</p>
            </div>

            <div class="portfolio-item">
                <p>Business Stationery</p>
            </div>

            <div class="portfolio-item">
                <p>Packaging Designs</p>
            </div>

            <div class="portfolio-item">
                <p>Creative Visual Projects</p>
            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- WHY CHOOSE US -->

    <section class="choose">

        <div class="section-heading">

            <h2>Why Choose Heady Creation?</h2>

            <p>
                Your vision deserves thoughtful creativity and excellence.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="choose-grid">

            <div class="choose-card">
                <h3>Creativity</h3>
                <p>
                    We approach every project with fresh ideas
