                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="choose-card">
                <h3>Professionalism</h3>
                <p>
                    We value quality, attention to detail
                    and professional service.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="choose-card">
                <h3>Commitment</h3>
                <p>
                    We are committed to turning ideas into
                    meaningful creative experiences.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- CONTACT SECTION -->

    <section class="contact" id="contact">

        <div class="section-heading">

            <h2>Let's Create Something Amazing</h2>

            <p>
                Have a project in mind? Let's bring your ideas to life.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="contact-content">

            <p>
                Get in touch with Heady Creation for professional
                graphic design, branding and printing services.
            </p>

            <a href="#"
               class="button">
                Contact Us
            </a>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- FOOTER -->

    <footer>

        <p>
            &copy; 2026 <span>Heady Creation.</span>
            All Rights Reserved.
        </p>

        <p>
            Creativity. Innovation. Excellence.
        </p>

    </footer>

</body>
</html>
